{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061243_21f3f616","chunk_index":22,"job_id":"mwjob_bb370670e7bc8936451212fd","precondition_digest":"4a6e79ad1a018b35e8d9fb9ec3e6615eae80ab09f96c3d0a0d5c5c36ea6962d6","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v9","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_c41ac953b62f7d4d"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061243_21f3f616","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:5de6bffe7e93b1061177fd1f","quote":"章节编号=14.5\n章节标题=项目特异附录\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"b5c7e48b70f93fb69e86c9974b7435ec6acd56542e22b20278f28e95feda0304","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:5de6bffe7e93b1061177fd1f","span_id":"span_selection_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。\n主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。\n关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。\n其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"12df43cfa4a17088af7cec6e9348b8a8d6d0546f30315937243812d04c70fca5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_definition_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。\n访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"dfda1e4a5c0bdfbbd1df9055000d3fa32a4447873b567ad83536040bced2e908","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_definition_visits"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_selection_identity","span_study_definition_endpoints","span_study_definition_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"项目特异附录","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本附录汇总本项目实施所需的项目特异评价工具与评估安排。疗效评价采用银屑病皮损面积和严重程度指数（PASI）、静态医师整体评估（sPGA）和皮肤病生活质量指数（DLQI）：PASI用于第16周PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）及第16周PASI评分较基线变化的评价；sPGA用于第16周达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例的评价；DLQI用于第16周DLQI评分较基线变化的评价。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价。研究访视安排为：筛选期最长4周，筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。","rationale":"事实依据：疗效评价采用PASI、sPGA和DLQI；主要终点为第16周PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%），关键次要终点为第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级及第16周PASI 90应答，其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线变化；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；研究时期为筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周，访视安排为筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视，第20周安全性随访。医学作者需核对各量表的版本、授权与培训要求，并确认项目特异附录的最终条目和呈现形式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_c41ac953b62f7d4d","section_number":"14.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:5de6bffe7e93b1061177fd1f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2410eb4e97ccdc","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:201bf55c2c14d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:43de5d7d9a7af4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2d13968ff4efdd"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:5de6bffe7e93b1061177fd1f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:5de6bffe7e93b1061177fd1f","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"9e14ba05f2a6db7154d4e5b86b4b1baf170005551bdedde902034b4571e06303"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:44|ch